        "body": "Amber fills are for things the user can act on (primary buttons, Save and Apply, Run Now) and for what they have chosen (selected filters, segments, day pills and type cards, switches when on, the active page). This is a deliberate decision (#709, declined 2026-11-25): screens may carry several amber controls. Amber is never decoration: headings, borders at rest, icons, backgrounds and status meaning use neutral or status tokens.",
        "section": "colors"
