        "name": "The Token-Only Rule",
        "body": "Components use only semantic tokens (`surface-*`, `text*`, `border*`, `vault*`, status, `hue-*`, `hue-*-bg`, `switch-*`). Raw palette classes (`amber-500`, `gray-700`, `bg-white`) and hex values in components break the five theme styles; `web/src/lib/palette-contrast.test.js` fails on any that come back.",
        "section": "colors"
