        "body": "No readable text below 12px (0.75rem), and sizes are set in rem so the browser's font-size setting still works. `text-2xs` is the floor; there are no pixel font sizes (`text-[11px]`) and no SVG text below it. `web/src/lib/design-guards.test.js` rejects pixel font sizes, and `tests/design-system.spec.ts` measures rendered text.",
